=== STICKY: Every feature in Anatomy 1.0.0: the body and its physics ===
[b]Every feature in Anatomy 1.0.0: the body and its physics[/b]
Each item's measurements are in [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/blob/master/docs/decisions.md]decisions.md[/url] (A-#).

[b]The body[/b]
[list]
[*]A real vulva, vaginal canal and anal opening, Nahka's geometry aligned to today's CBBE. 22,488 shared vertices are exactly CBBE's; the 2,811 new or changed ones meet the skin within 0.46 units. (A-4, A-9)
[*]Built from your own CBBE, skin and skeleton by the Anatomy Builder (the latest [font=Courier New]AnatomyBuilder[/font] zip on the [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/releases]GitHub releases page[/url]; the Nexus download holds the game files only). Nothing of CBBE's or Nahka's files is uploaded; Nahka's work ships as a patch, with her permission. The rebuild equals the direct build to 7×10⁻⁸. (A-23)
[*]The genitals are their own shape with their own material, textured to your skin's tone. The seam step fell from 9.0/4.0/8.1 to 2.3/1.1/1.9 (of 255), and every texel outside the genitals is byte-identical to your skin. (A-10, A-22)
[*]"Opening, front", a BodySlide slider in the Anatomy category. (A-25)
[*]The hip fold: the worst edge stretch in legs-up poses fell from 11.1x to 4.0x (sitting 10.3x to 3.8x, walking 3.5x to 2.0x). (A-30)
[*]The neck seam, with Anatomy Rebuild: 14.4° median, 37.5° worst → 0.0° and 0.3°. (A-37)
[/list]
[b]Physics[/b]
[list]
[*]Openings open because contact pushes them, never because an animation poses them. The bones are added at run time to whatever skeleton you load, which also cured the fin tears: kneeling 2,613 torn edges → 0, lying back 3,824 → 0. (A-14, A-21)
[*]Outer lips jiggle and squish aside. (A-13) The vaginal entrance is fitted to the partner, tuned in game over several rounds. (A-9, A-15, A-19)
[*]The anus opens on its real ring, reproducing 94% of the source's own shape. (A-14, A-28)
[*]Contact is one smooth tube for a penis: thrust wobble anus 0.69 → 0.21, vagina 0.26 → 0.13. (A-35)
[*]Held props collide; a rifle or a mug does not. Super mutants' and other creatures' penis bones collide too.
[/list]
[b]The penis[/b] (AAF scenes only)
[list]
[*]Auto-aim into the vagina, anus or mouth the pose implies; bends along her canal; deep throat follows her head and neck; a gripping hand is recognised. (A-28, A-29)
[*]A thinner shaft and a bigger head (×1.2 to 1.25), different per man, on BodyTalk4 without touching its files. (A-31)
[*]A slightly redder glans, a LooksMenu overlay with an MCM switch. (A-31)
[/list]
[b]The mouth[/b]
[list]
[*]Opens to what is in it, over the animation's own expression. (A-20)
[*]Lips shrink-wrap the shape inside, corners open or hug, and they close quickly between strokes. The real width is read, head included. (A-31, A-32)
[*]Her face reacts while her mouth is busy, and her brows frown as he goes deeper orally. (A-26, A-29)
[/list]

=== STICKY: Arousal, settings, Anatomy Rebuild, and what is confirmed ===
[b]Arousal, settings, Anatomy Rebuild, and what is confirmed[/b]

[b]Arousal[/b]: every 3 s, each woman within about 43 m moves toward her strongest cause (A-16):
[list]
[*]in an AAF scene: 1.0, half-life 10 s
[*]Ivy's own arousal (CompanionIvy): 0.8, 20 s
[*]a companion's Overture desire: 0.7 × desire, 45 s
[*]watching a scene within about 17 m: 0.55, 30 s
[*]naked: 0.3, 45 s; nothing: fades, 60 s
[/list]
Nipples respond on top of her own body (LooksMenu). Under armour Silhouette marks heavy they stay flat, and re-show when Silhouette rebuilds her. Nothing calls into AAF; only its busy keyword is read.

[b]MCM, page "Anatomy"[/b] (the same defaults without MCM)
[list]
[*][i]Arousal nipples[/i] on: off removes every change this mod made to anyone's nipples.
[*][i]Nipple response[/i] 1.0 (0-2) · [i]Rise speed[/i] 1.0 (0.25-4): a scene takes her halfway up in 10 s · [i]Fade speed[/i] 1.0 (0.25-4): halfway back a minute after the cause is gone.
[*]Sources, each on: [i]Being in a scene[/i], [i]Watching a scene[/i], [i]Companions' own arousal[/i], [i]Being naked[/i].
[*][i]Glans colour[/i] on: off takes it off every man it was given to.
[/list]
[b]Faces and eyes, with Rapport[/b]: Rapport's face is the one that shows in every AAF scene, lip sync is kept, and she glances into her partner's eyes for 4-7 s. (A-27, A-34)

[b]Anatomy Rebuild[/b] (optional, the latest [font=Courier New]AnatomyRebuild[/font] zip on the [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/releases]GitHub releases page[/url]): every CBBE outfit gets the body's hip handover (up to 3.8 units of gap before; a combat-armour leg on all fours 5.10 → 2.25), and the neck seam fix. It never runs BodySlide and never moves a vertex, morph or slider. Measured on 24 outfits against our own verified pipeline, weights equal to 0.0000; a second run changes nothing; [i]--undo[/i] puts your builds back. (A-36, A-37, A-39)

[b]Install and safety[/b]: nothing of another mod is overwritten; the builder refuses rather than guesses and writes each file in one step, with a log; the release checks itself (records, no developer keys, every file listed back, the engine built from the public commit it names). MO2 and Vortex, Steam and GOG 1.10.163.

[b]Not yet confirmed in game[/b]: fisting and big-toy stretch (A-17), toys as one tube (A-38), Rapport's MCM knobs for the physics, and brows following vaginal and anal depth (A-33). [b]Known limits[/b]: in a two-hole position the aim chooses by geometry alone; men's own openings are not modelled; the wrist can show a faint line against the hands. Tell us what you see.
